{"lines":[{"x":0.14834591139029915,"y":0.11182882594839771,"h":0.035506236806502223,"t":"Sample answers for Writing tasks","c":1,"w":0.6337565612792968},{"c":1,"h":0.026803976477766112,"x":0.14813854385150896,"y":0.17346424250634851,"t":"TEST 1, WRITING TASK 1","w":0.32769907633463535},{"w":0.18609022776285811,"x":0.14849623940706563,"c":1,"h":0.014574192142916442,"t":"SAMPLE ANSWER","y":0.21216999369609024},{"h":0.018511207811462427,"c":1,"y":0.24781980322524444,"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 5.5 score. Here is the","w":0.73698404947916663,"x":0.14654275429156521},{"c":1,"w":0.18796991984049483,"t":"examiner's comment:","h":0.014586359012994321,"x":0.1466165435383992,"y":0.26593689645567564},{"y":0.29430616379604291,"x":0.18972887634586746,"w":0.68632909138997411,"h":0.020694049803272607,"c":1,"t":"The candidate has identified all the key features (hospital, ring road, new public"},{"x":0.18984961812288295,"c":1,"y":0.3124999998253275,"w":0.71616541544596346,"h":0.018895348808647183,"t":"car park, staff car park and bus station in 2010) but the descriptions are not always"},{"t":"accurate e.g. [two features that still remained. This two features are City Hospital","y":0.33017169489951836,"w":0.70312026977539066,"c":1,"x":0.18978859876285659,"h":0.018937961408881709},{"y":0.34851934551875918,"c":1,"h":0.019220663514048164,"t":"and staff car park] whereas the staff car park was formerly a car park for both staff","w":0.71069585164388016,"x":0.1897609901565776},{"h":0.018878872902717281,"w":0.69562459309895841,"y":0.36661242634457614,"c":1,"t":"and public, while the mention of the bus station is not developed. Organisation is","x":0.18978014027553922},{"c":1,"x":0.18973450712044893,"t":"clear, however, with some good use of cohesive devices [According to | Apart from |","y":0.38365569836556945,"w":0.72391443888346352,"h":0.021932789838782329},{"t":"The further additional features], although there is an error in the use of reference","h":0.024078991823018314,"c":1,"y":0.39932933907612922,"x":0.18966801814870754,"w":0.69583216349283861},{"t":"pronouns [This\/These two features]. The range of vocabulary is sufficient for the","y":0.41951583408463433,"x":0.18790473010801273,"c":1,"h":0.019437553494189963,"w":0.69375178019205741},{"t":"task [two different years | features | remained | additional], though [features] is","y":0.43688445564049305,"w":0.67693130493164066,"x":0.18596727881181285,"h":0.020822865227615117,"c":1},{"x":0.18787565217273935,"y":0.45497600807339844,"w":0.65432805379231773,"h":0.019728063692681097,"t":"over-used. A spelling error is noted in the second line [sourrounded] but this","c":1},{"h":0.019270557322505155,"t":"does not cause any difficulty for the reader; similarly, the use of [around-tur]","c":1,"x":0.18786943186575381,"w":0.66561391194661457,"y":0.47296678362728395},{"y":0.49009000214812559,"h":0.020207576420102957,"w":0.69192835489908855,"c":1,"x":0.1878688834793574,"t":"can be easily understood as 'roundabout. There is a mix of simple and complex"},{"t":"sentences, mainly used accurately.","c":1,"w":0.30848093668619792,"h":0.020831762094000283,"y":0.50746478587530341,"x":0.18596480209002864},{"c":1,"y":0.53633720945479235,"w":0.69924809773763019,"x":0.14285715398063814,"t":"Two maps illustrate the way to get to a city hospital of two different years (2007 and 2010).","h":0.020348836895119127},{"y":0.56344945328170637,"w":0.74648549397786457,"h":0.023373192997801606,"x":0.14460144957881207,"c":1,"t":"According to both maps, the main features which is city hospital is sourrounded by Ring Road. In"},{"x":0.14277850419266902,"t":"these two maps, there have been two features that still remained. This two features are City Hospital","c":1,"y":0.58450659003897321,"w":0.76517486572265625,"h":0.021783245354411118},{"w":0.75591471354166673,"x":0.14273818948967668,"y":0.60425606401050347,"t":"and staff car park. Apart from these two features there are some features that shows on 2010 map","h":0.022988171402439361,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"but haven't shown on 2007 map. The additional features that appear on the map of 2010 are public","y":0.62627491902166688,"x":0.14278767392260316,"w":0.75764190673828113,"h":0.020631189585806675},{"t":"car park which located on the east-side of the city hospital. The further additional features are two","x":0.14275574813123323,"w":0.76146916707356771,"c":1,"y":0.64542005741556097,"h":0.021888917135716279},{"y":0.66709594364083336,"c":1,"w":0.51503758748372397,"t":"around-turn on the hospital Rd. which can lead to the bus station.","h":0.018995492594977459,"x":0.1428571459092518},{"w":0.76716985066731769,"c":1,"h":0.023321091553048734,"y":0.69390482089501837,"x":0.14271350278253161,"t":"Overall, there are two major features that never change on both 2007 and 2010 map. These features"},{"t":"are city hospital and staff car park. However, there are some additional features that appear","y":0.71560084992302275,"w":0.70316848754882821,"x":0.14277074311014776,"h":0.021470639142234682,"c":1},{"t":"on the map of 2010 but not on 2007. These features are public car park, bus station and two","c":1,"x":0.14273633398333724,"y":0.73541598536362096,"h":0.024019163958272527,"w":0.71075246175130213},{"c":1,"x":0.14077762894882787,"t":"around-turns.","y":0.75703676120492991,"w":0.11713493347167966,"h":0.016610820448483055},{"c":1,"y":0.93750000001864953,"t":"126","x":0.14097744288717343,"w":0.033834587732950838,"h":0.013081395234588733}],"w":2400,"h":3106}